{"id":"653071","name":"鲜虾玉米荷兰豆沙拉","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/653071/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"荷兰豆","amount":"80g"},{"name":"玉米粒","amount":"80g"},{"name":"白虾","amount":"4只"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"40g"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"80g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"取荷兰豆摘洗干净。","img":"images/653071/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切段。","img":"images/653071/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"玉米粒和胡萝卜冷水下锅焯水。","img":"images/653071/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放处理干净的白虾。","img":"images/653071/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煮熟，捞出虾。","img":"images/653071/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捞出胡萝卜和玉米粒。","img":"images/653071/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"黄瓜处理干净。","img":"images/653071/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"切厚片。","img":"images/653071/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放玉米胡萝卜里拌匀。","img":"images/653071/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放荷兰豆焯水。","img":"images/653071/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"开锅煮几十秒捞出。","img":"images/653071/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放玉米里。","img":"images/653071/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"虾去壳切段。","img":"images/653071/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放虾和食盐，不瘦身人士可以放沙拉酱。","img":"images/653071/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/653071/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/653071/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}